<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-BULGARIA BEAT THAILAND 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BULGARIA BEAT THAILAND 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria beat Thailand 4-0 (halftime 2-0) in a friendly soccer international on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Marian Hristov (10, 15), Emil Kostadinov (40), Daniel Borimirov (58)</p>
